"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkempora_for_woocommerce_docs=globalThis.webpackChunkempora_for_woocommerce_docs||[]).push([[3361],{34782(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"plugin-download-and-corrected-pages-2026-11-07","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/plugin-download-and-corrected-pages-2026-11-07","source":"@site/changelog/2026-11-07-plugin-download-and-corrected-pages.md","title":"Free download from your dashboard, and corrected pages","description":"Free accounts can download the plugin from the dashboard, the tools moved to ZTools, and the home and pricing pages now match what the plugin does.","date":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Free download from your dashboard, and corrected pages","description":"Free accounts can download the plugin from the dashboard, the tools moved to ZTools, and the home and pricing pages now match what the plugin does.","slug":"plugin-download-and-corrected-pages-2026-11-07","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1794036985000,"nextItem":{"title":"An update screen, and policies that match what Empora does","permalink":"/changelog/update-screen-and-corrected-policies-2026-11-06"}},"content":"Free accounts can now download Empora for WooCommerce from **Downloads** on the dashboard, until the plugin is listed on WordPress.org.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n- Our free tools moved to ZTools. Old tool addresses go straight to the same tool there.\\n- We corrected the home and pricing pages, which listed things the plugin does not do, including Apple sign-in and a Google Drive export.\\n- Pages open faster, and a long store address no longer breaks the store card on a phone."},{"id":"update-screen-and-corrected-policies-2026-11-06","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/update-screen-and-corrected-policies-2026-11-06","source":"@site/changelog/2026-11-06-update-screen-and-corrected-policies.md","title":"An update screen, and policies that match what Empora does","description":"Empora can now ask you to update when a fix matters. The Privacy and Cookie Policies were corrected against the code, and usage counting is now told once at the foot of your first visit.","date":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"An update screen, and policies that match what Empora does","description":"Empora can now ask you to update when a fix matters. The Privacy and Cookie Policies were corrected against the code, and usage counting is now told once at the foot of your first visit.","slug":"update-screen-and-corrected-policies-2026-11-06","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793961447000,"prevItem":{"title":"Free download from your dashboard, and corrected pages","permalink":"/changelog/plugin-download-and-corrected-pages-2026-11-07"},"nextItem":{"title":"Page tours on Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals","permalink":"/changelog/tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals-2026-10-29"}},"content":"When a fix matters, Empora can now ask you to update before you carry on, and tells you why.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nAn urgent update shows a full screen with the reason and one **Update now** button. A normal update tells you once, then becomes required the next time you open Empora. Your licences and stores are saved either way.\\n\\nWe also read the Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy against the code and corrected them. The plugin sends no error reports and no administrator email. It sends your licence key, site URL, site name and version numbers.\\n\\nEmpora now counts how it is used by default and says so once, in the bar at the foot of your first visit. Session recording runs only for signed-out visitors on public pages, with text and inputs masked. Your account pages are never recorded, and the Privacy preferences panel is gone."},{"id":"tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals-2026-10-29","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals-2026-10-29","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-29-tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals.md","title":"Page tours on Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals","description":"Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals now have their own page tour, so every page of your Empora account has one.","date":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Page tours on Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals","description":"Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals now have their own page tour, so every page of your Empora account has one.","slug":"tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals-2026-10-29","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793291225000,"prevItem":{"title":"An update screen, and policies that match what Empora does","permalink":"/changelog/update-screen-and-corrected-policies-2026-11-06"},"nextItem":{"title":"Your Empora account, redesigned and built for your phone","permalink":"/changelog/your-account-on-a-phone-2026-10-29"}},"content":"Every page of your Empora account now has a page tour.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Three new tours\\n\\n- **Downloads** shows the free edition, the premium download for each licence, how to install it, and what\\n  Empora holds.\\n- **AI drafts** shows how many drafts your plan leaves you this month, where to ask for a draft, and the\\n  Generate draft button.\\n- **Referrals** shows your referral link, how close you are to the next free plan month, and your sign-ups.\\n\\nStart one with the map button in the header, labelled **Take a tour of this page**.\\n\\n## Smaller changes\\n\\n- An expired licence now carries an **Expired** tag in Billing \u2192 Licences.\\n\\nDetails: [Your Empora Account and Page Tours](/getting-started/your-empora-account)."},{"id":"your-account-on-a-phone-2026-10-29","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/your-account-on-a-phone-2026-10-29","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-29-your-account-on-a-phone.md","title":"Your Empora account, redesigned and built for your phone","description":"The Empora account has a new look on every page, and on a phone it now works like an app, with a bottom bar for Overview, Licences, Stores, AI drafts and More.","date":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Your Empora account, redesigned and built for your phone","description":"The Empora account has a new look on every page, and on a phone it now works like an app, with a bottom bar for Overview, Licences, Stores, AI drafts and More.","slug":"your-account-on-a-phone-2026-10-29","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-10-29T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793268779000,"prevItem":{"title":"Page tours on Downloads, AI drafts and Referrals","permalink":"/changelog/tours-on-downloads-ai-drafts-and-referrals-2026-10-29"},"nextItem":{"title":"AI drafts in your Empora account","permalink":"/changelog/ai-drafts-2026-10-28"}},"content":"Every page of your Empora account has a new look, and on a phone the account now works like an app.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## A bar for the pages you use most\\n\\nOn a phone, a bar along the bottom of the screen holds **Overview**, **Licences**, **Stores**, **AI drafts** and\\n**More**. **More** holds Downloads, Billing, Referrals and Settings, as well as How Empora works, notifications,\\nappearance settings and signing out.\\n\\n## Actions within reach\\n\\nEach page\'s main action, such as **Sync every store** or **Generate draft**, sits just above the bar. Dialogs\\nopen as sheets from the bottom of the screen, and the page tours run on the phone layout too.\\n\\nDetails: [Your Empora Account and Page Tours](/getting-started/your-empora-account)."},{"id":"ai-drafts-2026-10-28","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/ai-drafts-2026-10-28","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-28-ai-drafts.md","title":"AI drafts in your Empora account","description":"A new AI drafts page writes a product description from your notes or answers how a module\'s settings work, with Speak for voice input.","date":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"AI drafts in your Empora account","description":"A new AI drafts page writes a product description from your notes or answers how a module\'s settings work, with Speak for voice input.","slug":"ai-drafts-2026-10-28","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793206088000,"prevItem":{"title":"Your Empora account, redesigned and built for your phone","permalink":"/changelog/your-account-on-a-phone-2026-10-29"},"nextItem":{"title":"Tour hints follow your account, and How Empora works from the home page","permalink":"/changelog/tour-hints-follow-your-account-2026-10-28"}},"content":"Your Empora account has a new page, **AI drafts**, after Stores.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\nDraft a product description, or ask how a module\'s settings work. You read every word before it goes anywhere.\\n\\n- **Product description** turns rough notes into a description you can paste into WooCommerce.\\n- **Help with module settings** answers how to set up one of Empora\'s modules, in short steps.\\n- **Speak** fills the box from your voice, through your browser\'s own speech recognition.\\n\\nEach plan includes a number of drafts a month, shown at the top of the page. Details:\\n[AI Drafts in Your Empora Account](/getting-started/ai-drafts)."},{"id":"tour-hints-follow-your-account-2026-10-28","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/tour-hints-follow-your-account-2026-10-28","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-28-tour-hints-follow-your-account.md","title":"Tour hints follow your account, and How Empora works from the home page","description":"The one-line tour offer now shows once for your account on every device, and the home page links straight to the How Empora works walkthrough.","date":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Tour hints follow your account, and How Empora works from the home page","description":"The one-line tour offer now shows once for your account on every device, and the home page links straight to the How Empora works walkthrough.","slug":"tour-hints-follow-your-account-2026-10-28","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-10-28T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793203838000,"prevItem":{"title":"AI drafts in your Empora account","permalink":"/changelog/ai-drafts-2026-10-28"},"nextItem":{"title":"Page tours in your account, and a How Empora works walkthrough","permalink":"/changelog/page-tours-and-how-empora-works-2026-10-27"}},"content":"The page tours now remember you, not just the device you used.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## One offer per page, on every device\\n\\nThe first time you open Overview, License, Stores, Billing or Settings, one line offers that page\'s tour. Once\\nyour account has seen it, it counts as seen on every device you sign in on. The map button in the header still\\nstarts the tour whenever you like.\\n\\n## How Empora works, from the home page\\n\\nThe home page now has a third button, **See how Empora works**, after **Get started** and **Explore\\nfeatures**. It opens [How Empora works](https://empora.aoneahsan.com/how-empora-works), six screens of the\\naccount, one step at a time, before you sign in.\\n\\nDetails: [Your Empora Account and Page Tours](/getting-started/your-empora-account)."},{"id":"page-tours-and-how-empora-works-2026-10-27","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/page-tours-and-how-empora-works-2026-10-27","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-27-page-tours-and-how-empora-works.md","title":"Page tours in your account, and a How Empora works walkthrough","description":"Overview, License, Stores, Billing and Settings now have a page tour behind a map button in the header, and How Empora works shows six screens of the account one step at a time.","date":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Page tours in your account, and a How Empora works walkthrough","description":"Overview, License, Stores, Billing and Settings now have a page tour behind a map button in the header, and How Empora works shows six screens of the account one step at a time.","slug":"page-tours-and-how-empora-works-2026-10-27","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793059758000,"prevItem":{"title":"Tour hints follow your account, and How Empora works from the home page","permalink":"/changelog/tour-hints-follow-your-account-2026-10-28"},"nextItem":{"title":"Bundle contents, paying from a balance on the Checkout block, and overpaid orders","permalink":"/changelog/bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance-2026-10-26"}},"content":"Your Empora account now shows you around itself.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## A tour on every page\\n\\nOverview, License, Stores, Billing and Settings each have a map button in the header. It walks you through the\\npage you are on, one highlighted area at a time. You can skip it, close it or jump to any step, and the button\\nstarts it again whenever you like. On a phone the steps open in a sheet at the bottom of the screen.\\n\\n## How Empora works\\n\\n[How Empora works](https://empora.aoneahsan.com/how-empora-works) shows six screens of the account, one step\\nat a time, before you sign in. It ends on **Open your dashboard**.\\n\\nDetails: [Your Empora Account and Page Tours](/getting-started/your-empora-account)."},{"id":"bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance-2026-10-26","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance-2026-10-26","source":"@site/changelog/2026-10-26-bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance.md","title":"Bundle contents, paying from a balance on the Checkout block, and overpaid orders","description":"The Bundles editor now builds a bundle\'s contents and where it is shown, customers can pay from store credit and wallet on the Checkout block, and an order edited to charge less can return the difference.","date":"2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"modules","permalink":"/changelog/tags/modules"},{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Bundle contents, paying from a balance on the Checkout block, and overpaid orders","description":"The Bundles editor now builds a bundle\'s contents and where it is shown, customers can pay from store credit and wallet on the Checkout block, and an order edited to charge less can return the difference.","slug":"bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance-2026-10-26","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["modules","release"],"date":"2026-10-26T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793036144000,"prevItem":{"title":"Page tours in your account, and a How Empora works walkthrough","permalink":"/changelog/page-tours-and-how-empora-works-2026-10-27"},"nextItem":{"title":"Documentation corrections \u2014 all 78 modules, and the new plan limits","permalink":"/changelog/documentation-corrections-2026-09-12"}},"content":"Three things changed in the plugin since the last update here, and the reference pages now describe them.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## Bundle contents in the Bundles editor\\n\\nThe bundle dialog builds the whole bundle: up to 50 items, each with its product, its variation when the\\nproduct is variable, default, minimum and maximum quantities, an optional item discount and an **optional**\\nswitch. You also choose the product pages that show the offer. Saving checks everything at once and points at\\neach problem. See [Product Bundles](/modules/reference/bundles#bundle-contents).\\n\\n## Paying from a balance on the Checkout block\\n\\nStore credit and wallet money can now pay part or all of an order on the Checkout block as well as the classic\\ncheckout. Store credit is used first, then the wallet, and when the balance covers the order no payment method\\nis needed. See [Wallet \u2192 Spending at checkout](/modules/reference/wallet#spending-at-checkout).\\n\\n## Overpaid orders\\n\\nWhen an order paid partly from a balance is edited to charge less, the order screen shows the overpaid amount\\nand returns it to the customer\'s balance in one step. See\\n[Wallet \u2192 Overpaid orders](/modules/reference/wallet#overpaid-orders)."},{"id":"documentation-corrections-2026-09-12","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/documentation-corrections-2026-09-12","source":"@site/changelog/2026-09-12-documentation-corrections.md","title":"Documentation corrections \u2014 all 78 modules, and the new plan limits","description":"Three modules were documented as unavailable in 1.0 after they had already been enabled. That is corrected across the site, along with the free, Starter and Professional record limits.","date":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"documentation","permalink":"/changelog/tags/documentation"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Documentation corrections \u2014 all 78 modules, and the new plan limits","description":"Three modules were documented as unavailable in 1.0 after they had already been enabled. That is corrected across the site, along with the free, Starter and Professional record limits.","slug":"documentation-corrections-2026-09-12","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["documentation"],"date":"2026-09-12T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793036144000,"prevItem":{"title":"Bundle contents, paying from a balance on the Checkout block, and overpaid orders","permalink":"/changelog/bundle-contents-and-checkout-balance-2026-10-26"},"nextItem":{"title":"1.0.0 \u2014 in preparation","permalink":"/changelog/1-0-0-in-preparation"}},"content":"This site said three modules could not be enabled in version 1.0. That stopped being true when they were\\nregistered, and the pages were not updated with them. Corrected today, along with the plan limits.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## All 78 modules register\\n\\n`inventory` (Advanced Inventory Management), `livechat` (Live Chat & Customer Support) and `store_credit`\\n(Store Credit & Wallet) were described across this site as being in the catalogue but impossible to switch\\non. They were registered on 2 September, and the documentation kept saying otherwise.\\n\\nEvery one of the 78 modules in the plugin\'s manifest registers and can be enabled. The only thing deciding\\nwhether you can switch a module on is whether your plan includes it.\\n\\nThe three modules\' reference pages were rewritten from the code they actually run, rather than described as\\nunreleased work:\\n\\n- [Advanced Inventory Management](/modules/reference/inventory) \u2014 stock per location, transfers with their\\n  own lifecycle, an audit log, and the daily low-stock alert.\\n- [Live Chat & Customer Support](/modules/reference/livechat) \u2014 the storefront widget, the agent roster,\\n  session assignment and transfer, and message polling.\\n- [Store Credit & Wallet](/modules/reference/store-credit) \u2014 the issued-credit ledger, and how it sits\\n  beside Wallet.\\n\\n## Wallet and Store Credit are two ledgers, not two versions of one feature\\n\\nDocumentation that treated Store Credit as a dropped duplicate of Wallet was wrong about what the two\\nmodules are for. **Wallet** holds money the customer paid in; **Store Credit** holds value the store issued \u2014\\ngoodwill, compensation, the value of a return. They keep separate ledgers because they are not the same\\nmoney. At checkout the customer sees one combined balance, and the issued credit is spent first, because it\\nis the store\'s own liability and it can expire.\\n\\n## Free, Starter and Professional no longer cap records\\n\\nThe product limits on how many products, orders and customers Empora\'s modules will process have been\\nremoved from the Free, Starter and Professional plans. All five tiers are now unlimited on those three\\ncounts.\\n\\nPrices, site counts and module counts are unchanged: Free $0 (1 site, 7 modules), Starter $19 (27 modules),\\nProfessional $49 (48 modules), Business $99 (3 sites, 68 modules), Enterprise $299 (unlimited sites, all 78).\\nImport and export allowances are unchanged too \u2014 they remain the practical difference between the tiers. See\\n[Plans & pricing](/pricing).\\n\\n## Also corrected\\n\\n- The [modules overview](/modules/overview) listed module names that no longer exist beside their\\n  replacements, and claimed the plugin carried \\"90+ module directories\\". It now lists the 78 real modules by\\n  area, with the key each one uses.\\n- The [referral program](/modules/reference/referral-program) page said neither reward type had anything\\n  listening for it, so no payout was ever delivered. Both types now have a listener, and a referral is marked\\n  paid only once delivery is confirmed. A store-credit reward is credited to the customer\'s wallet, so it\\n  needs the Wallet module enabled.\\n- `llms.txt`, which is what AI assistants read, carried the same false module claim and the old plan limits."},{"id":"1-0-0-in-preparation","metadata":{"permalink":"/changelog/1-0-0-in-preparation","source":"@site/changelog/2026-08-29-1-0-0-in-preparation.md","title":"1.0.0 \u2014 in preparation","description":"Empora for WooCommerce 1.0.0 has not been released yet. What the first release contains, and what this changelog will carry once it ships.","date":"2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[{"inline":true,"label":"release","permalink":"/changelog/tags/release"}],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"The Empora team","url":"https://empora.aoneahsan.com","page":null,"key":"empora-team"}],"frontMatter":{"title":"1.0.0 \u2014 in preparation","description":"Empora for WooCommerce 1.0.0 has not been released yet. What the first release contains, and what this changelog will carry once it ships.","slug":"1-0-0-in-preparation","authors":["empora-team"],"tags":["release"],"date":"2026-08-29T00:00:00.000Z"},"unlisted":false,"lastUpdatedAt":1793036144000,"prevItem":{"title":"Documentation corrections \u2014 all 78 modules, and the new plan limits","permalink":"/changelog/documentation-corrections-2026-09-12"}},"content":"**Empora for WooCommerce 1.0.0 has not been released yet.** No version has been published to\\nWordPress.org, to CodeCanyon, or to the Play Store. This page is the changelog those releases will\\nappear in, and this first entry records what 1.0.0 contains so the documentation and the software\\ndescribe the same thing when it ships.\\n\\n\x3c!-- truncate --\x3e\\n\\n## What 1.0.0 contains\\n\\n**78 modules**, each independently switchable, all of which register and are usable in this version.\\nSeven of them are the free core and need no license: Product Filters, Reviews Enhancement, Wishlist,\\nProduct Compare, Social Media Integration, SEO & Schema Markup, and Dynamic Pricing. The rest are\\nunlocked by a plan. The full list, with the plan each module belongs to, is the\\n[module reference](/modules/reference).\\n\\n**One admin surface.** A single **Empora** menu in WordPress admin holding the Modules grid, a unified\\nSettings store, a Dashboard reporting license and module status, and Reports.\\n\\n**HPOS compatibility.** Empora declares compatibility with WooCommerce High-Performance Order Storage and\\nreads orders through the WooCommerce order APIs rather than querying post tables directly, so it runs on\\nstores that have made the switch.\\n\\n**Plans that the software enforces.** Five tiers \u2014 Free, Starter, Professional, Business and Enterprise \u2014\\nwith per-plan module sets, site counts and record limits. See [Plans & pricing](/pricing).\\n\\n## What 1.0.0 does not contain\\n\\nBeing specific about this matters more than the feature list:\\n\\n- **No self-serve purchase.** No payment provider ships in 1.0, so there is no checkout. Paid plans are\\n  arranged by [contacting the author](/support). The plans themselves are real and enforced.\\n- **No WordPress.org listing yet.** Installation is by uploading the plugin ZIP \u2014 see\\n  [Installation](/getting-started/installation).\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\nWordPress 6.2 or newer, WooCommerce 8.0 or newer, PHP 8.1 or newer. Details and hosting notes are in\\n[Requirements & compatibility](/reference/requirements).\\n\\n## Subscribing\\n\\nThis changelog publishes an [RSS feed](https://empora-docs.aoneahsan.com/changelog/rss.xml). Subscribe to it if you want release notes\\nwithout checking back."}]}}')}}]);